  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forward Thinking. Bridging the gap: creating spaces for dialogue between young Tunisians and the political establishment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the democratic process in Tunisia by increasing the capacity of the next generation of Tunisian political leaders and activists and by increasing the representativeness of the political establishment to youth issues and concerns.

Impact will be determined through surveys of participants&#x2019; attitudes and actions over the course of the project and through reviewing national and international media polling data.</narrative>
  </description>
